# Case-Study Authority Matrix

| Case | Identity basis | Quantity basis | Tier | Target hash | Important limitation |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| YSL L'Homme | User-supplied 70-identity secondary roster plus official brief | Rank prior, functional correction, and inferred stock plan | Identity-rich hypothesis | `6a81b871565b77287e49963f8254f46f18f443dc8dde6857695739b4e76e3c80` | Percentages are not public or authenticated |
