| Prada L'Homme | Official notes and label evidence, family graph, and perfumery priors | From-scratch functional ensemble center | Tier 1-2 | `5cc1f7e696d17ad805e104310f419644be9ba5dde9e548c7149e1225039e3618` | No detailed public identity roster or calibrated chromatogram |

A longer formula does not automatically have greater authority. Identity detail, quantity authority, and sensory validation remain separate dimensions.
